silm:instances_papers_01_orientation_chapters_flat_sections_05_cannon_or_gpt_absorption_concrete_anchor_5#mittensincomingyonedaprofile silm:hasLongDescription "The MittensIncomingYonedaProfile is the incoming Yoneda profile of Mittens: contravariant functor X -> Hom(X, Mittens). In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'Y^in_Mittens', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
